Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.01,0:00:05.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马）星光体 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.21,0:00:07.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在哪 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.06,0:00:09.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（轨道7）不能再往前了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.93,0:00:11.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}救命啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.09,0:00:13.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的兄弟 轨道5 轨道6！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.79,0:00:16.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}波奇！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.99,0:00:20.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什 什么啊 那是什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.53,0:00:22.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力）哇啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.27,0:00:32.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）怎么看都不像是在欢迎我们呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.16,0:00:36.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看招～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.69,0:00:38.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.43,0:00:47.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.29,0:00:50.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）嘿呀～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.33,0:00:53.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 快走！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.22,0:00:54.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.19,0:00:55.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里交给我们来想办法。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.38,0:00:57.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你先走！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.12,0:00:58.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.30,0:01:08.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凯西）接招吧 委员长！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.00,0:01:11.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。游马同学，请去吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.20,0:01:14.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}撑住啊，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.35,0:01:16.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.24,0:01:18.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈啊——！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.47,0:01:24.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底我才不会被你们这种人抓住呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.34,0:01:26.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这边，这边！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.26,0:01:37.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）这样一来，你的生命值就只剩我的一半了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.80,0:01:40.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，你打算怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.67,0:01:44.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖一张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.24,0:01:52.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？难道你已经无计可施了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.45,0:01:55.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.31,0:01:57.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《对快斗来说，防守是行不通的。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.67,0:02:00.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，如果是你的话会怎么做？》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.58,0:02:09.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶——快打开啊，快打开！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.66,0:02:14.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快点！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.66,0:02:15.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.89,0:02:21.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呀啊——！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.58,0:02:23.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔叽——！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.30,0:02:28.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔唔唔　那些家伙　既然这样…。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.81,0:02:32.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？　轮到你的回合了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.35,0:02:35.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《答案　早就显而易见了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.71,0:02:37.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是一飞冲天吧　游马》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.90,0:02:42.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我　召唤兹巴巴骑士！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.11,0:02:45.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（兹巴巴骑士）兹巴巴——　兹巴——！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.65,0:02:50.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且我　将１张手牌送入墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.02,0:02:51.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤滚栗子！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.38,0:02:53.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（滚栗子）栗子——！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.57,0:02:58.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后　发动魔法卡　投下交换！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.77,0:03:01.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是将场上的２只以上
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.28,0:03:02.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽送入墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.82,0:03:05.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将合计等级数量的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.64,0:03:07.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从手牌特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.70,0:03:10.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将等级３的兹巴巴骑士和
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.03,0:03:13.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级１的滚栗子送入墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.08,0:03:15.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤影蜥蜴！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.44,0:03:19.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽不能通常召唤{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.14,0:03:22.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只能从手牌特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.17,0:03:24.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级４的怪兽有２只。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.87,0:03:29.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把哥哥哥魔像和影蜥蜴叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.42,0:03:31.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用两只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.40,0:03:34.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建超量网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.80,0:03:36.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.32,0:03:41.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.39！ 希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.42,0:03:49.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！ 等着我 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.78,0:03:51.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一定会把你救出来的！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.17,0:03:57.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是 快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.20,0:04:00.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}另一个人 到底是……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.91,0:04:04.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.70,0:04:16.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.22,0:04:19.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}继续与你之间的契约。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.65,0:04:20.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}契约？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.59,0:04:25.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打开这扇门的人将获得全新的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.64,0:04:31.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 那个人作为代价将失去最重要的东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.54,0:04:35.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然而 有人要妨碍那份契约。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.24,0:04:36.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.22,0:04:40.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用你的力量，把那家伙排除掉。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.12,0:04:44.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}飞进这扇门里，将泽阿尔的力量拿到手。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.33,0:04:48.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果你有那份觉悟的话。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.01,0:04:41.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}泽阿尔？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.00,0:06:25.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身了吗，No.怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.36,0:06:27.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.60,0:06:30.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对光子雷欧发动攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.07,0:06:33.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普剑斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.70,0:06:47.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我早就看穿你了，你的底牌！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.23,0:06:51.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！铠甲后背！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.10,0:06:53.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是在装备了装备魔法的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.36,0:06:55.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽被破坏的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.15,0:06:58.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以破坏前的状态将其复活！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.01,0:07:01.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复活吧，光子雷欧！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.13,0:07:12.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《把光子雷欧复活了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.82,0:07:16.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼是以攻击力２０００以上的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.62,0:07:19.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽２体作为素材的怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.89,0:07:21.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要来了吗！？》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.58,0:07:24.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 盖1张卡 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.78,0:07:27.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}泽阿尔啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.47,0:07:30.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再也不饶恕你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.31,0:07:32.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们完蛋了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.86,0:07:36.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快死心吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.22,0:07:38.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是……我记得。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.08,0:07:42.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}轨道7！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.33,0:07:48.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咿…… 哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.52,0:07:50.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}废铁！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.40,0:07:55.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要变成废铁了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.58,0:07:57.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.61,0:07:59.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.61,0:08:00.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不要啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.66,0:08:05.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！？ 拔不出来！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.01,0:08:06.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暂时 是你的回合。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.70,0:08:08.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望你拉出来！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.67,0:08:09.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜托了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.10,0:08:16.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.97,0:08:19.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 召唤光子环法师！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.02,0:08:24.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（光子环法师）嚯嚯嚯。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.37,0:08:26.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光子奔行者的攻击力是1000。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.90,0:08:29.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 银河眼就无法特殊召唤了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.43,0:08:31.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那可不一定哦？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.28,0:08:35.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动装备在光子狮上的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.04,0:08:38.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光子枪的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.00,0:08:40.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备了光子枪的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.13,0:08:41.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在作为特殊召唤的素材时
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.88,0:08:43.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以当作2只来使用。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.30,0:08:43.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.90,0:08:46.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让你见识一下 我的灵魂。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.67,0:08:55.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}降临吧 光之化身
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.49,0:08:58.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼光子龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.39,0:09:00.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终于出现了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.30,0:09:04.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼光子龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.28,0:09:06.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼 攻击霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.46,0:09:11.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破灭的光子流！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.01,0:09:13.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼 效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.37,0:09:16.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼进行战斗时
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.07,0:09:17.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那2只除外。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.91,0:09:18.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.41,0:09:22.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 你的场地就空空如也了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.12,0:09:26.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 光子环士直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.51,0:09:31.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！ 呜……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.88,0:09:33.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗结束时
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.32,0:09:36.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼和霍普 在场上复活。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.29,0:09:42.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 由于银河眼的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.66,0:09:46.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吸收霍普的超量素材。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.18,0:09:48.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每吸收一个超量素材
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.38,0:09:49.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.37,0:09:51.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力提升５００点。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.42,0:09:53.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力 ４０００！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.77,0:09:55.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}furthermore 从手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.88,0:09:58.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动速攻魔法银河风暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.65,0:10:01.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡 将超量素材为零的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.67,0:10:04.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}１只超量怪兽破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.38,0:10:06.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消失吧 霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.16,0:10:09.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动陷阱 超量反射！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.60,0:10:11.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在怪兽超量
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.74,0:10:13.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被效果破坏时
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.30,0:10:15.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个效果无效
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.82,0:10:18.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并给对手８００点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.52,0:10:23.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？哇啊！！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.22,0:10:24.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…有两下子。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.57,0:10:26.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过这点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.76,0:10:27.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}忘了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.81,0:10:31.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在银河眼面前，霍普根本无力。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.48,0:10:35.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完，我的一飞冲天还没有结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.86,0:10:38.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.38,0:10:42.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让你见识一下，真正的霍普之姿！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.25,0:10:44.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当生命值不满１０００时
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.28,0:10:47.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以场上的霍普为素材
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.01,0:10:49.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.87,0:10:57.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，CNo.３９！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.74,0:11:03.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望之力，将混沌化为光明的使者希望皇霍普雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.86,0:11:13.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能，CNo.！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.40,0:11:17.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.竟然有这种力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.44,0:11:21.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 攻击力是银河眼更高
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.77,0:11:22.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}胜出！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.99,0:11:25.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的目标并不是银河眼！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.52,0:11:29.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇霍普雷的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.05,0:11:32.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用一个叠放单位
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.08,0:11:33.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个回合 霍普雷的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.95,0:11:35.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升500点。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.29,0:11:38.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叠放充能！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.20,0:11:46.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 此时 对方怪兽的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.31,0:11:48.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力下降1000点。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.41,0:11:50.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我选择 光子环士。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.61,0:11:54.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这 这是？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.13,0:11:58.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 霍普雷攻击光子环士！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.00,0:12:01.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普剑混沌斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.93,0:12:09.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.29,0:12:11.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干掉了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.18,0:12:16.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.25,0:12:17.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真遗憾啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.53,0:12:20.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你破坏掉的光子环绕者
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.06,0:12:22.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在被攻击时产生的伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.82,0:12:24.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拥有减半的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.77,0:12:27.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《居然扛住了刚才的攻击吗》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.47,0:12:32.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我丢弃一张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.18,0:12:34.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来形势就逆转了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.54,0:12:37.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.74,0:12:40.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在银河眼面前消失吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.60,0:12:43.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破裂的光子流！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.99,0:12:50.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动 洁癖的屏障 清净之力！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.36,0:12:54.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡的效果是当对方怪兽发起攻击时
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.74,0:12:58.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方怪兽的攻击力恢复为原本的攻击力。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.15,0:13:03.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.41,0:13:05.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原本攻击力是3000。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.52,0:13:08.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此我受到的伤害是500！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.85,0:13:09.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜呜！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.43,0:13:15.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔，没能干掉他吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.78,0:13:18.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过，你的生命值只剩400了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.31,0:13:24.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管霍普展现出怎样的真身到此为止了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.87,0:13:26.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.33,0:13:35.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，皇之键。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.59,0:13:43.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《快斗，果然这个男人是赢不了的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.29,0:13:45.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马》
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.71,0:13:52.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《永别了》
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.58,0:13:56.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这是什么？》
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.96,0:14:02.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}皇之键！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.82,0:14:04.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体，星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.84,0:14:06.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回答我！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.59,0:14:15.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体，星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.33,0:14:22.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这、这里是？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.35,0:14:25.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，跳进那扇门里。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.24,0:14:32.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}跳进这扇门中去获得全新的力量吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.78,0:14:34.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔……。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.80,0:14:36.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 那个人作为代价
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.86,0:14:39.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会失去最重要的东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.02,0:14:42.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你有 这份觉悟吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.07,0:14:47.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.11,0:14:51.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《游马 是游马吗？》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.98,0:14:54.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯 你 没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.50,0:14:56.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗已经开始了对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.52,0:15:02.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《游马 很遗憾我的生命值已是风中残烛》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.42,0:15:06.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好 你等着我现在就去你那里！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.12,0:15:09.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《等等 游马》哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.14,0:15:11.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这里和你所在的世界不同。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.51,0:15:14.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你来了之后能否平安无事我不确定。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.70,0:15:18.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 这本来就是我自己的战斗》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.07,0:15:21.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体 你别一个人把全部
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.94,0:15:23.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都扛在自己身上啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.63,0:15:26.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我和你不是一心同体吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.36,0:15:30.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是泽阿尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.45,0:15:31.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《什么！》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.55,0:15:33.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}门的声音告诉我。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.57,0:15:36.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去得到泽阿尔的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.59,0:15:38.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么你会知道泽阿尔的事？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.28,0:15:42.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你知道泽阿尔是什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.15,0:15:45.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《据说能拯救我的世界的奇迹之力》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.85,0:15:49.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但那个人作为代价
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.21,0:15:51.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会失去最重要的东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.58,0:15:54.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我会得到手的，星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.28,0:15:58.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要能救你不管付出什么代价。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.81,0:16:01.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超一飞冲天啊！我！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.68,0:16:04.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.08,0:16:12.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.11,0:16:14.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.98,0:16:20.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.36,0:16:22.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 用我自己和游马
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.89,0:16:26.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.25,0:16:28.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当遥远的两道灵魂交汇之时
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.61,0:16:32.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}传承之力将会显现。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.14,0:16:34.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.85,0:16:38.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天吧 我！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.38,0:16:42.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量变换 泽阿尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.44,0:16:46.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.83,0:16:52.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么……回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.25,0:17:20.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什……什么啊这是？这就是我？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.12,0:17:22.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 是我的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.98,0:17:24.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马／星光体）泽阿尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.34,0:17:27.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个声音 九十九游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.86,0:17:30.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们合体了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.40,0:17:34.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 你们的生命值 仅仅只有４００。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.10,0:17:37.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就只有那么点吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.47,0:17:39.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要赢啊游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.49,0:17:42.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把一切赌在这张抽卡上。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.10,0:17:42.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.52,0:17:47.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最强决斗者的决斗 一切都是必然。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.22,0:17:49.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就连抽到的卡也是由决斗者创造的。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.42,0:17:51.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}集中精神，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.78,0:17:54.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.13,0:17:55.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.98,0:17:59.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马／星光体）所有的光芒啊，力量啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.35,0:18:05.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}寄宿于我右臂之上照亮希望之路吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.08,0:18:08.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闪光抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.82,0:18:14.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，异热同心武器。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.70,0:18:19.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}独角兽王之枪！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.74,0:18:25.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}独角兽王成为霍普雷的装备卡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.28,0:18:29.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使霍普雷的攻击力提升１９００。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.02,0:18:36.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}切换，独角兽之枪！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.57,0:18:40.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，银河眼的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.02,0:18:41.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就被霍普雷超越了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.47,0:18:47.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力４４００！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.00,0:18:48.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备了独角兽王之枪的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.64,0:18:49.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普雷{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.35,0:18:50.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.81,0:18:54.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}离开场地的效果无效化！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.07,0:18:56.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 银河眼就逃不掉了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.76,0:19:00.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！！ 异热同心武器！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.12,0:19:03.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马／星光体）独角兽斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.19,0:19:08.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呃！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.55,0:19:11.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！ 光子冲击！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.42,0:19:15.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光子冲击的效果是 当光子怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.29,0:19:16.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在战斗中受到伤害时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.63,0:19:20.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那份伤害由双方玩家承受。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.49,0:19:22.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.53,0:19:27.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼！ 啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.05,0:19:28.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.91,0:19:30.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.34,0:19:39.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗… 你为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.94,0:19:43.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要收集 No.卡啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.05,0:19:45.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么要做这种像恶魔爪牙一样的事…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.93,0:19:49.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.29,0:19:54.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是为了弟弟才把灵魂卖给了恶魔。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.50,0:19:56.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}弟弟…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.38,0:20:00.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说 那是！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.73,0:20:04.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底 发生了什么啊在你身上。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.09,0:20:06.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙还给你。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.46,0:20:09.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是 鲨鱼的灵魂？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.22,0:20:18.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（右京）看来你醒了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.57,0:20:20.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（鲨鱼）我 我…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.23,0:20:22.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（右京）看来是真的啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.45,0:20:25.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马所说的话。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.53,0:20:26.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.82,0:20:28.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（警报声）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.84,0:20:30.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（轨道7）你们在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.21,0:20:31.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！你们这些家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.37,0:20:34.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！哇 这下不妙了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.17,0:20:35.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊——！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.07,0:20:37.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.60,0:20:39.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发生什么事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.45,0:20:41.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总而言之 快逃吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.31,0:20:42.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.06,0:20:44.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是 游马他…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.69,0:20:47.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.34,0:20:50.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙没事的！相信他！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.57,0:20:53.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）游马！游马！！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.79,0:20:58.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.53,0:21:06.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.39,0:21:08.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.69,0:21:22.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.55,0:21:26.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.08,0:21:27.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔… 咕哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.60,0:21:29.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.81,0:21:35.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿嘿！哟 小鸟！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.17,0:21:37.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的！什么哟不哟的！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.53,0:21:39.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是个笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.13,0:21:40.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你还活着啊 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.73,0:21:44.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈！我怎么可能死… 哇啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.79,0:21:48.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟她们）游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.81,0:21:51.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我没事的！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.34,0:21:53.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.07,0:22:03.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《九十九游马…》
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.11,0:22:05.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.58,0:22:19.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，我有个问题想问你。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.11,0:22:20.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什、什么啊，突然这么正经。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.80,0:22:24.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，你T恤上的那个“D”是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.87,0:24:13.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马T恤上的“D”是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.30,0:26:54.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决、决斗的“D”啊，这还用说。

